invent during commit creation.

## No AI/Codegen Traces Hard Gate

NO signatures, trailers, comments, PR text, or other traces attributable to
generative AI or code generation are allowed in code, commits, PRs, reviews,
or comments.

## Commit Message Contract

All commits MUST use: `<type>(<scope>): <description>`

Tracked work MUST include: `Refs: <PLAN item IDs>, <commit_group ID>`

Optional body sections are strongly suggested, especially for medium or large
commits.

## Mandatory Commit Group Hard Gate

Every `commit_group` MUST be committed immediately on completion, and work
MUST NOT continue on the next `commit_group` before the current one is
staged and committed.

